            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " asa do kiirasi akirot naka EJAKAIT, yes aatoŋot naka Yuda. Inera kwanata EJAKAIT loka ajoresio, Edeke loka Isirael ebe: Arai kitogogonoto akusikonyen eut alomar akwap nako Misiri, kolototo aiboi ŋina; ",
          "type": "text",
