        },
        {
          "text": "“Naarai inera kwanata EJAKAIT loka aioresio, Edeke loka Isirael ebe, Kwape abu akanyunyura ka akadedeŋ kobukokinor mama ejaas luibojete koYerusalem, kwape kwaŋin ebukokinor akadedeŋ mamakus, arai kilomas Misiri; iraunete yesi aimuario, ka aumokiner, ka ekenit, ka amorosit, mam bobo ianyunete aibois na. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
